“The pair became parents in June and have a son named Robert Ray Black-Daley, and Daly himself says his “whose worldview” has changed.
"If you had asked me last year, I'd have told you that I'm only interested in winning a gold medal," he said.
“You know, there’s more important things than the Olympic gold medals.
