His son is named after his father Robert, who died in 2011 at the age of 40 after being diagnosed with brain cancer.
Daly reassured that his father couldn't accept that he was going to die and one of the last things he asked about was whether they already had tickets to the 2012 London Olympics - as he wanted to be in the front row.
