The following year Daly competed at the 2012 Olympics and won a bronze medal.
“I just knew all my life I’ve ever dreamed of jumping at the Olympic Games in front of the audience at home. There wasn’t a better feeling,” he said.
This also inspired the choice of his first song - "Proud" by Heather Smol - which accompanied him during his run-up to the Olympic Games and still made him bristle.
